# ============================================================
# Legacy / reserved — not currently referenced in codebase
# but preserved for future use.
#
# The following blocks contain env vars that were once active
# in routes, workers, or automation pipelines that are now
# archived, deprecated, or on hold:
#
#   - DIFY_*_KEY variants (dedup, karte, template-selector,
#     design-theme, product-matcher, freelance-autoreply,
#     video-script-generator, video-provider-selector)
#   - STRIPE_PRICE_* price IDs
#   - Passive inventory zone / CZDS / ICANN credentials
#   - Source API keys (DataForSEO, WhatWeb, Wappalyzer, Urlscan,
#     PublicWWW, Mozilla Observatory, SecurityTrails, Shodan,
#     Censys, Houjin Bangou, Google Places, Google PSI,
#     Google CrUX, Hunter, Apollo, Fumadata, Bizmap,
#     GBIZ, Apify, Outscraper, RapidAPI, Crunchbase,
#     Meta Ad Library, RSSHub, SerpApi, Tavily, Abstract,
#     Moz, StoreLeads, CartLeads, AppFigures, AppTweak,
#     Ahrefs, SimilarWeb, Pytrends, Yelp, Wellfound,
#     Clutch, Sortlist, Shopify Experts, Webflow Experts,
#     Snov, EventsEye, TenTimes)
#   - Video / media worker URLs (FasterWhisper, MoviePy,
#     ShortVideoMaker, LivePortrait, EdgeTTS, CosyVoice,
#     XTTSv2, FFCreator, Editly, WhisperX)
#   - Miscellaneous: Subfinder, HTTPx, MobSF, TheHarvester,
#     Whoogle, Overpass, WhoIsDS, RSSHub job route,
#     MassDNS, MCP tokens, Chrome MCP, Camoufox
# ============================================================
